  "prefLabel": "Plc 803.01 Eligibility for Initial Registration as an Ophthalmic Dispenser",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 803.01 Eligibility for Initial Registration as an Ophthalmic Dispenser. Any individual not currently or previously registered who wishes to register as an ophthalmic dispenser shall:\n\n(a) Be at least 18 years of age; and\n\n(b) Have obtained a high school diploma or have passed a test that resulted in the receipt of a certificate of high school equivalency.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 800) #13885 eff 4-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc800.html"
